    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13378" root="دود" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَائِدٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدِيدٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَوِّدٌ</span></b>  (Msb) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدُودٌ</span></b> 
(L) [the last from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِيدَ</span>, confirming my opinion
that <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَيَّدَ</span> in some copies of the K is a mistranscription,] Corn, or food, (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَعَامٌ</span>,) <i>having in it</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُود</span>
[or <i>worms,</i> &amp;c.]; (L, Msb;) and <i>becoming eaten
thereby.</i> (L.)

